menu "SempreIoT device table (siot_devtab)"

    config SIOT_DEVTAB_CAP
        int "Maximum devices in the board's table"
        default 120
        range 8 250
        help
            One NVS blob per device (~57 bytes = 3 NVS entries) in the 24 KB
            "nvs" partition shared with Wi-Fi. 120 leaves headroom; 250 needs
            the partition decision recorded in the OTA blueprint §8
            (installation-lifecycle-v1.md §3.1). Never raise it in the field.

endmenu
